cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "service-zone: one zone, as one deployable thing"
abstract: >
  A service: the packing of the transport layers and interactors that share a
  ring into one deployable thing. It holds no code of its own -- what runs
  together, and why the membership is what it is. iceoryx2 is shared memory, so
  anything exchanging per-tick data is on one machine, and the membership falls
  out of that rather than being chosen.
